The app downloads and runs the following third-party artefacts on the user's
machine. They are not distributed inside this repository or inside a packaged
build.

Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct
  Alibaba Cloud (Qwen team)
  Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-GGUF, quantized by unsloth, with its mmproj image encoder
  Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct
  https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-GGUF

  The chat template shipped in qwen-vl-template.ts is adapted from Qwen's
  multimodal tool-calling template (Apache-2.0), with the generation prompt's
  <think> line removed for a model that has no thinking mode.

llama.cpp
  The ggml-org contributors
  MIT License.
  A pinned CPU build is downloaded from the official llama.cpp releases.
  https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp

EmbeddingGemma 2 (Recall, optional)
  Google DeepMind
  Gemma Terms of Use.
  Downloaded only when the user turns Recall on.
  https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-300m

The Qwen model and EmbeddingGemma are downloaded by the app at the user's
request; their licences travel with the downloaded files. The Apache-2.0 licence
in LICENCE covers this repository's own source.
